\text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \left| \sum_{i=1}^{n} (x_i y_{i+1} - x_{i+1} y_i) \right|
$$

Where $ (x_{n+1}, y_{n+1}) = (x_1, y_1) $, i.e., we wrap around to the starting point of the polygon.

